		"description": "The Faceless are the children of Malassa, masters of espionage, intelligence and covert action. Of all the followers of the Dragon Gods, the Faceless are the most mysterious and unknown. The little that ordinary people hear of them is that they usually hide in shadow and mystery. Most people know them only as a flickering image glimpsed from the corner of the eye, something half-familiar, or the feeling of being watched... The Faceless walk in the shadows: they step into one shadow and come out of another. The Faceless need no words; they speak to one another by telepathy. They are seldom trusted by their allies, and always feared by their enemies.",
