			"plural": "Shade Dragons"
		},
		"description": "Shade Dragons are avatars of Malassa, the Dragon God of Darkness. They take the form of onyx dragons with purple orbs set in their wings: the Eyes of Malassa, which can see every shadow, whether real shadows or what they stand for. The Shadow Lurkers are said to be born from these glowing orbs. When an angry Shade Dragon spreads its wings, the countless eyes bewilder its enemies and summon the most terrible nightmares to destroy their minds. When deadlier means are needed, Shade Dragons also use the strength of their bodies and their withering breath to burn away their enemies' lives, slowly but surely.",
